<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 84 0 R
/T (In this class, students learn A  Magnetic Light Indicator system uses a magnetic sensor to detect the presence of a magnet and control an LED. When a magnet comes close, the sensor activates the LED, providing a visual indication. It is commonly used in door sensors and position detection systems.)
/E (In this class, students learn A  Magnetic Light Indicator system uses a magnetic sensor to detect the presence of a magnet and control an LED. When a magnet comes close, the sensor activates the LED, providing a visual indication. It is commonly used in door sensors and position detection systems.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
